                "text": "As Pennie open enrollment begins today, hundreds of thousands of Pennsylvanians are seeing their premiums skyrocket or getting priced out of health care coverage altogether.\n\u00a0\nHouse Democrats want to extend ACA tax credits to STOP this shutdown of health care. Why don't most House Republicans want to join us?",
