                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Because of Trump and Congressional Republicans\u2019 refusal to extend ACA tax credits, Pennsylvanians are seeing their health care costs more than double!\n\nIf YOU are seeing your premiums increase this Pennie open enrollment season \u2014 I want to hear from you! Share your price increases with my office here: https://t.co/FiWWtIejOp",
