                "text": "This shouldn\u2019t be a red or blue issue. Across Pennsylvania, health care premiums WILL skyrocket if we do not extend the ACA tax credits.\n\nHouse Democrats are working to ensure millions of Americans don\u2019t see a shutdown of their health care. Will House Republicans join us? https://t.co/S87o1I5eBI",
