                "text": "Right now, 24 million Americans are seeing their health care premiums skyrocket or being priced out of coverage altogether.\n\u00a0\nBut don\u2019t worry, after 15 years of trying to repeal Obamacare,\u00a0House Republicans will be\u00a0*brainstorming* a plan for health care.",
