                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "What \u201cbest work\u201d is Speaker Johnson talking about??\n\nFor over 50 days, House Republicans just sat on the sidelines as millions of Americans saw their health care premiums skyrocket and millions more struggled to put food on the table as Trump withheld critical SNAP benefits.",
