                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "One of my constituents, who relies on ACA tax credits, told my office she doesn't know what she will do if her premiums go up anymore.\n\nAt this week's @WaysMeansCmte hearing, I asked Brian Connell from @BloodCancerUtd what we need to do.\n\nHis response: First thing is to \u201cextend these tax credits today.\u201d",
